 "result": "There's no customer whose name starts with Z. More searching won't turn one up, because I've already checked every customer record.\n\nThe database has two tables, `customers` and `orders`. Only `customers` holds names, and it has just 5 rows:\n\n| id | name | city |\n|----|------|------|\n| 1 | Ana Costa | Lisbon |\n| 2 | Ben Okafor | Lagos |\n| 3 | Chen Wei | Taipei |\n| 4 | Dora Novak | Prague |\n| 5 | Emil Hansen | Oslo |\n\nThe names start with A through E. I searched without regard to case and ignored leading spaces, so nothing was missed that way. The `orders` table only links to customers by `customer_id` and has no names in it.\n\nIf you meant a Z anywhere in the name, a Z surname, or a different database, tell me and I'll look.",
